{"unit_id":"Lbunc__dsh-local-llm-controller#feature-1","repo":"Lbunc/dsh-local-llm-controller","commit":"21e837fbf904295a15ba959dad162620817c9a8b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Local LLM Controller 的功能「本地服务控制」：在插件卡片选择槽位、文本或视觉模式及预设后启动 llama-server；卡片显示状态、错误和日志，并可停止服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:604-648","lib/index.js:386-412","lib/index.js:808-905"]}
